<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Products & barcodes · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>.product-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:14px}.product-row small{display:block;margin-top:5px}#products>details{margin:12px 0}#products summary{padding:14px;font-weight:700;background:#eadcf5;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer}#editor{max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;width:min(700px,96vw)}#product-photo{display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:240px;object-fit:contain;margin:12px auto}#product-photo[hidden],#photo-file[hidden]{display:none}#title{outline:none}input[readonly]{background:#eee9f1;color:#61566d}#editor .actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;background:#fff4e8;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #ddd0e9}#photo-status,#editor-status{overflow-wrap:anywhere}#editor-status:not(:empty){position:sticky;bottom:88px;background:#fff2cf;color:#452056;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d3b076;border-radius:12px;z-index:2}.product-photo-section{padding-bottom:18px;margin-bottom:18px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd0e9}.setup-panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9c9e9;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;margin:16px 0}.setup-panel h2{margin-top:0}.setup-panel progress{width:100%;height:20px;accent-color:#7ab720}.setup-panel select{max-width:100%;width:100%}.setup-warning{color:#a12b21!important;font-weight:650}.setup-detail{color:#71558b!important}.setup-done{color:#34731c}.editor-checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:7px;padding-left:20px}.storage-fields{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd0e9;margin-bottom:16px}#setup-summary{font-size:14px}#setup-count{font-weight:750}#save-next{background:#35116c;color:white}#editor .actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}</style></head><body><main><h1>Products & barcodes</h1><p>Scan a product or find it by name, SKU or UPC. Each SKU identifies its own product.</p><div class="toolbar"><input id="search" placeholder="Scan or search products" aria-label="Search products"><button type="button" id="lookup-barcode">Look up barcode</button><button id="refresh">Refresh QuickBooks</button><button id="keyboard">Hide keyboard</button></div><p id="message" role="status"></p><section class="setup-panel" aria-labelledby="setup-heading"><h2 id="setup-heading">Product setup checklist</h2><p id="setup-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><progress id="setup-progress" value="0" max="1" aria-label="Products ready for scanning and storage"></progress><p id="setup-summary"></p><label for="setup-filter">Show products</label><select id="setup-filter"><option value="catalog">All products</option><option value="essential" data-label="Missing picking essentials">Missing picking essentials</option><option value="all" data-label="Any missing profile detail">Any missing profile detail</option><option value="scanCode" data-label="Missing scan code">Missing scan code</option><option value="storage" data-label="Missing storage area">Missing storage area</option><option value="sku" data-label="Missing SKU · update in QuickBooks">Missing SKU · update in QuickBooks</option><option value="photo" data-label="Missing photo">Missing photo</option><option value="weight" data-label="Missing weight / size">Missing weight / size</option><option value="description" data-label="Missing description">Missing description</option><option value="category" data-label="Missing category · update in QuickBooks">Missing category · update in QuickBooks</option><option value="alternateBarcode" data-label="No UPC / alternate barcode · optional">No UPC / alternate barcode · optional</option></select><p>Progress updates after each saved change. A SKU can be scanned as an internal barcode; a manufacturer UPC is optional. Photos and profile details help identify products but do not block picking.</p></section><div id="products"></div><dialog id="editor"><form id="details"><h2 id="title" tabindex="-1" autofocus></h2><ul id="editor-checks" class="editor-checks" aria-label="Product setup status"></ul><section class="storage-fields"><h3>Storage area</h3><select id="zone" aria-label="Product storage area"><option value="">Choose storage area</option><option value="freezer">Freezer</option><option value="refrigerated">Refrigerated</option><option value="dry">Dry</option></select><label><input id="fresh" type="checkbox"> Fresh produce</label><button type="button" id="save-storage">Save storage</button></section><section class="product-photo-section"><h3>Product identification photo</h3><img id="product-photo" hidden><p id="photo-status" role="status"></p><input id="photo-file" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><button type="button" id="take-photo">Take photo</button><button type="button" id="choose-photo">Choose existing photo</button></section><label>Product name<input name="name" required></label><label>SKU · managed in QuickBooks<input name="sku" readonly aria-readonly="true"></label><p>Change the SKU directly in QuickBooks, then refresh this list.</p><label>Weight / size<input name="weight"></label><label>Description<textarea name="description"></textarea></label><button class="primary">Save product information</button><h3>Barcode aliases</h3><div id="barcodes"></div><label>New barcode<input id="code" autocomplete="off"></label><button type="button" id="add">Add barcode</button><p id="editor-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="save-next">Save & next incomplete product</button><button type="button" id="close">Close</button><button type="button" id="hide">Hide keyboard</button></div></form></dialog></main><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/warehouse-products.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/product-request-review.js"></script></body></html>
